"""Paper 2 · Unit 9 · P2-U9-06 Multiple Access, Devices & VLANs, P2-U9-07 IPv4 Addressing, P2-U9-09 Transport Layer and
P2-U9-10 World Wide Web & Applications (4 topics × 2 sub-topics × 30).
References: Behrouz A. Forouzan, Data Communications and Networking (5th ed., chs. 12, 17, 18–19, 23–26); Tanenbaum, Computer Networks.
Each set mixes REAL previous-year questions (exact wording, printed option order, `source`) with new ones. Official answers: KEA final keys
for Legislative Council Secretariat 2024 (Computer Operator P2, Junior Console Operator P2 – booklet A1) and GTTC 2024 (Lecturer CS – A1,
Technician Gr-III CS – C1). KSET/KEA 2026 questions come from packs/pyq-p2.json (answers worked out by ExamSim). Skipped: Junior Console
Operator P2 Q57 (official key looks wrong). ICMP/ARP/routing questions are kept for U9-08. ALOHA, CSMA/CD, subnetting, fragmentation,
congestion-window and RTT numbers checked by computation."""
from packlib import AR, I_II
from p2u7_a import kset, PYQ, KLC, GTTC, NOTE

